{"q":"110","t":"Balanced Binary Tree","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a binary tree, determine if it is <span data-keyword=\"height-balanced\"><strong>height-balanced</strong></span>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/0edc4f05e23112f4.jpg\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 221px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [3,9,20,null,null,15,7]\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/f0df341df3b6dc90.jpg\" style=\"width: 452px; height: 301px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [1,2,2,3,3,null,null,4,4]\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = []\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is in the range <code>[0, 5000]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"isBalanced\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"root\",\r\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Binary Tree","slug":"binary-tree"}],"s":[{"t":"Maximum Depth of Binary Tree","s":"maximum-depth-of-binary-tree","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"K-th Largest Perfect Subtree Size in Binary Tree","s":"k-th-largest-perfect-subtree-size-in-binary-tree","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Check Balanced String","s":"check-balanced-string","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Anduril","anduril"],["Apple","apple"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",8],["Google","google",5],["Microsoft","microsoft",5],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2],["Anduril","anduril",2]],"b":[["Meta","facebook",4]],"m":[["Viasat","viasat",5],["Visa","visa",3]]}}